# Browser-visible values only: this file feeds Vite, whose VITE_* variables are compiled into
# the bundle and readable by anyone. Never put a secret here. Declare each one in
# src/shared/config/env.ts. The API is always reached at relative /api, so there is no API URL
# variable, and no client-address header either: the server sees the browser's address through
# the dev server, nginx or itself.
